- Collapsed view: Single-line div showing truncated notes text (CSS `text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden`). If notes is empty, show muted "Add notes..." placeholder. Click anywhere on the collapsed bar to expand.
- Expanded view: Textarea (3-4 rows, auto-resize up to 6 rows) with the draft text. Auto-focus on expand.
- Auto-save: `useEffect` with 1-second debounce timer. When `draft` changes and differs from `notes` prop, start timer. On timer fire, call `onSave(draft.trim())`. Clear timer on unmount or new keystroke.
- Blur save: On textarea blur, if draft differs from notes, save immediately (cancel any pending debounce).
- Cmd/Ctrl+Enter: Save immediately and collapse.
- Escape: Revert draft to current `notes` prop, collapse without saving.
- Sync prop changes: When `notes` prop changes (e.g., from SSE sync) and the user is NOT editing (`!isExpanded`), update `draft` to match.
