1. **API catch-all must not intercept registered routes:** Go 1.22+ ServeMux uses most-specific-pattern-wins, so `/api/auth/token` (when registered) will always beat `/api/`. Verify this in testing.
2. **Loom proxy at `/api/loom/`:** The loom proxy uses `mux.Handle("/api/loom/", ...)` which is more specific than `/api/` — no conflict.
