- `reconcileConfig(oldConfig, newConfig *DaemonConfig)` — diffs agents and calls drain/add
- `configHash(dc *DaemonConfig) string` — computes hash for no-op detection
- `diffAgents(old, new []AgentEntry) (added, removed []AgentEntry, modified []AgentEntry)` — categorizes changes

### 2. `internal/cli/daemon_reconciler_test.go` (~200 LOC)
