## Technical Approach

**High-level strategy:** Add a compact repo line below the existing role line in AgentCard's `.info` column, using the RepoBadge component for the colored pill and a muted cross_repo indicator (↔ symbol) inline. In AgentDetailPanel, add a \"Repos\" row to the existing `<dl className={styles.infoGrid}>` section that renders RepoBadge(s) and cross_repo status. Both files also get their duplicated color utils replaced with shared imports.

